---
title: Aperol Spritz
description: A bitter-sweet Italian aperitivo of Aperol, prosecco and soda.
author: IBA
source: https://iba-world.com/iba-cocktail/spritz/
course: drink
cuisine: italian
diet: vegan
difficulty: easy
servings: 1
time: 5m
tags: [aperol, sparkling, built, aperitivo, iba]
---

Fill a large #wine glass{} with ice.

Add @Prosecco{90%ml}, @Aperol{60%ml}, and @soda water{30%ml}.

Stir gently to combine without losing the bubbles.

Garnish with an @orange slice{garnish}.
